  the P520 scenario VV-1-RangeGain of the ElectricRange_V2 model in the p520 branch of the SAME archive:
  the cross-branch links below carry an archive-root-relative Link with a #fragment that names the
  scenario (resolved by lotar-tools against the archive root) and a Target_Id that identifies it
  everywhere. This is the first instance of a requirement -> behavioral-model link inside one archive,
  which the WG decision made legitimate. Content is illustrative; P510 itself is not in this project's
  scope and its own archival Schematron layer does not exist yet.
-->
